{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/extras/c33bb528a6a7e96786b8956b1087301a.avif?t=1761298878\" width=898 height=506 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/extras/5ccf9f324161de78e10adb9e73b1173f.poster.avif?t=1761298878\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/extras/5ccf9f324161de78e10adb9e73b1173f.webm?t=1761298878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/extras/5ccf9f324161de78e10adb9e73b1173f.mp4?t=1761298878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During a brutal attack by the Black Bears, Kliff loses his Greymane comrades, his family in all but name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid the turmoil that grips the continent of Pywel, he sets out to find the scattered survivors, rebuild the fallen Greymanes, and reclaim the homeland they once called their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Vast, Seamless World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/extras/7ef7da8ed313bfd7653fa787a7d07179.poster.avif?t=1761298878\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/extras/7ef7da8ed313bfd7653fa787a7d07179.webm?t=1761298878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/extras/7ef7da8ed313bfd7653fa787a7d07179.mp4?t=1761298878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The continent of Pywel, brought to life as a seamless open world, is brimming with countless destinies awaiting your discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day you may face a trial so harsh it brings you to your knees. The next day you might find yourself captivated by the gentle gaze of an innocent creature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this boundless land, even the simplest request could set you on the path to a fateful encounter and reveal an unexpected truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >May Solumen\u2019s blessing guide you on your journey across the living, breathing expanse of Pywel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relentless Action, Brutal Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/extras/5c96ca9a49d2e1c1be26fd9c6d59d8a8.poster.avif?t=1761298878\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/extras/5c96ca9a49d2e1c1be26fd9c6d59d8a8.webm?t=1761298878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/extras/5c96ca9a49d2e1c1be26fd9c6d59d8a8.mp4?t=1761298878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the unforgiving battlefields of Crimson Desert, there is no single path to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From swords, spears, bows to powerful abilities and elemental enhancements, take advantage of the wide arsenal of weapons and skills available to you and create lethal combinations to unleash even greater power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every strike and move, forge your own way in a world where a split second can decide your fate in fast-paced, visceral battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dawning Fate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/extras/d42b5ef3780494476dedf1c7b2158af9.poster.avif?t=1761298878\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/extras/d42b5ef3780494476dedf1c7b2158af9.webm?t=1761298878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/extras/d42b5ef3780494476dedf1c7b2158af9.mp4?t=1761298878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the continent of Pywel, the rival factions of Pailune maintained a tense balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At Kliff's side stood his steadfast Greymane comrades: Oongka, Yann, and Naira.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That fragile peace was shattered with the sudden assault of the Black Bears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Those Who Fight to Protect, and Those Who Fight to Torment.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/extras/f80cb3a05bef8f4ffeb017707176f6de.poster.avif?t=1761298878\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/extras/f80cb3a05bef8f4ffeb017707176f6de.webm?t=1761298878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/extras/f80cb3a05bef8f4ffeb017707176f6de.mp4?t=1761298878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Greymanes fall one by one in their clash against the Black Bears. In a desperate struggle against their fearsome leader Myurdin, Kliff and the few Greymanes who survive are scattered to the winds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Beginning of a New Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/extras/33e6f12f783a829ad6251729e5eca971.poster.avif?t=1761298878\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/extras/33e6f12f783a829ad6251729e5eca971.webm?t=1761298878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/extras/33e6f12f783a829ad6251729e5eca971.mp4?t=1761298878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kliff, etching the names of his fallen companions into his heart, vows to rebuild the Greymanes and exact vengeance upon the Black Bears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along this path, he would meet those who seek to upend the very order of the continent and face a mission unlike any he has ever known.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3321460?t=1761298878","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/3eb4fa25db870d727842f0d0a3399597b6c2d22f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761298878","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/f4b3cbf1c0759e0f18cbc0bf13cdefa02451c95b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761298878","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/f4b3cbf1c0759e0f18cbc0bf13cdefa02451c95b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761298878","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Digital Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/extras/4a6039fb47fdc5f220b2e8fa417420e0.avif?t=1761298878\" width=1024 height=1024 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A plentiful adventure with the Deluxe Pack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a diverse adventure with more armor, horse tack, and cosmetics for Kliff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Deluxe Pack]</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kairos Plate Helm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kairos Plate Gloves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kairos Plate Boots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kairos Cloak</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Kairos Plate Armor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Balgran Shield</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Exclaire Champron</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Exclaire Barding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Exclaire Saddle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Exclaire Stirrups</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>Pre-Purchase Offer</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/extras/9c69d1fe484da510d1798f6cfac673ec.avif?t=1761298878\" width=802 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pre-order Crimson Desert now to receive exclusive bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first step of this epic journey is about to begin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Pre-order Exclusive Bonus]</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Khaled Shield</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/extras/c33bb528a6a7e96786b8956b1087301a.avif?t=1761298878\" width=898 height=506 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/extras/5ccf9f324161de78e10adb9e73b1173f.poster.avif?t=1761298878\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/extras/5ccf9f324161de78e10adb9e73b1173f.webm?t=1761298878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/extras/5ccf9f324161de78e10adb9e73b1173f.mp4?t=1761298878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During a brutal attack by the Black Bears, Kliff loses his Greymane comrades, his family in all but name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid the turmoil that grips the continent of Pywel, he sets out to find the scattered survivors, rebuild the fallen Greymanes, and reclaim the homeland they once called their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Vast, Seamless World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/extras/7ef7da8ed313bfd7653fa787a7d07179.poster.avif?t=1761298878\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/extras/7ef7da8ed313bfd7653fa787a7d07179.webm?t=1761298878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/extras/7ef7da8ed313bfd7653fa787a7d07179.mp4?t=1761298878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The continent of Pywel, brought to life as a seamless open world, is brimming with countless destinies awaiting your discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day you may face a trial so harsh it brings you to your knees. The next day you might find yourself captivated by the gentle gaze of an innocent creature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this boundless land, even the simplest request could set you on the path to a fateful encounter and reveal an unexpected truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >May Solumen\u2019s blessing guide you on your journey across the living, breathing expanse of Pywel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relentless Action, Brutal Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/extras/5c96ca9a49d2e1c1be26fd9c6d59d8a8.poster.avif?t=1761298878\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/extras/5c96ca9a49d2e1c1be26fd9c6d59d8a8.webm?t=1761298878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/extras/5c96ca9a49d2e1c1be26fd9c6d59d8a8.mp4?t=1761298878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the unforgiving battlefields of Crimson Desert, there is no single path to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From swords, spears, bows to powerful abilities and elemental enhancements, take advantage of the wide arsenal of weapons and skills available to you and create lethal combinations to unleash even greater power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every strike and move, forge your own way in a world where a split second can decide your fate in fast-paced, visceral battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dawning Fate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/extras/d42b5ef3780494476dedf1c7b2158af9.poster.avif?t=1761298878\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/extras/d42b5ef3780494476dedf1c7b2158af9.webm?t=1761298878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/extras/d42b5ef3780494476dedf1c7b2158af9.mp4?t=1761298878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the continent of Pywel, the rival factions of Pailune maintained a tense balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At Kliff's side stood his steadfast Greymane comrades: Oongka, Yann, and Naira.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That fragile peace was shattered with the sudden assault of the Black Bears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Those Who Fight to Protect, and Those Who Fight to Torment.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/extras/f80cb3a05bef8f4ffeb017707176f6de.poster.avif?t=1761298878\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/extras/f80cb3a05bef8f4ffeb017707176f6de.webm?t=1761298878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321460/extras/f80cb3a05bef8f4ffeb017707176f6de.mp4?t=1761298878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Greymanes fall one by one in their clash against the Black Bears. In a desperate struggle against their fearsome leader Myurdin, Kliff and the few Greymanes who survive are scattered to the winds.</p><p class=\"b